+        "",
+        "- Dashboard presentation mode reruns only short, lower-risk PFs live.",
+        "- PF-1, PF-3, PF-4, PF-6, and PF-7 preserve existing result evidence for a stable live flow.",
+        "- Full validation remains `bash performances/run_all.sh` and is not replaced by this profile.",
+    ])
+    (hist / "summary.md").write_text("\n".join(lines) + "\n", encoding="utf-8")
+
